<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>AskAstro – Account & Data Deletion Policy</h1>
        <p><strong>Application:</strong> AskAstro</p>
        <p><strong>Package Name:</strong> com.app.askastro</p>
        <p>We respect your privacy and provide a straightforward way to request the complete deletion of your account and all associated personal data.</p>

        <h2>1. How to Request Account Deletion</h2>
        
        <h3>Option A: In-App Deletion (Instant)</h3>
        <div class="step-box">
            <ol>
                <li>Open the <strong>AskAstro</strong> app.</li>
                <li>Go to <strong>Settings / Profile</strong> screen.</li>
                <li>Scroll down and tap <strong>"Delete Account"</strong>.</li>
                <li>Confirm the prompt. Your account and personal data will be deleted immediately.</li>
            </ol>
        </div>

        <h3>Option B: Web / Email Request</h3>
        <p>If you have uninstalled the app or cannot access your account, send an email to our support team:</p>
        <div class="step-box">
            <p>📧 Email: <a class="email-link" href="mailto:support@askastro.app">support@askastro.app</a> (or your developer contact email)</p>
            <p><strong>Subject:</strong> Account Deletion Request - AskAstro</p>
            <p><strong>Information needed in email:</strong> The email address or Google account used to register in AskAstro.</p>
            <p><em>Account deletion requests via email are processed within 48 to 72 hours.</em></p>
        </div>

        <h2>2. Data That Is Deleted Upon Request</h2>
        <p>When your deletion request is completed, the following data is permanently removed from our active servers and Firestore databases:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Personal Profile Data:</strong> Full Name, Email Address, Gender, Date of Birth, Time of Birth, Place of Birth.</li>
            <li><strong>Astrological Profile Data:</strong> Generated Kundali charts, planetary calculation records, saved match profiles.</li>
            <li><strong>Authentication Records:</strong> Firebase Auth credentials, Face ID identifier token.</li>
            <li><strong>AI Chat & Question History:</strong> Questions asked to the AI astrologer and associated AI responses.</li>
            <li><strong>Uploaded Media:</strong> Profile photos or avatars stored in Firebase Storage.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Data Retention Period</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Immediate Removal:</strong> All personal identifiers and user data are purged from production databases immediately upon deletion.</li>
            <li><strong>Backups & Logs:</strong> Routine encrypted database backups and transient crash logs that may contain anonymous diagnostic IDs are automatically overwritten and purged within <strong>30 days</strong>.</li>
            <li>No user data is retained for commercial or advertising purposes after account deletion.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Last updated: September 2026 | AskAstro Support Team</p>
        </div>
    </div>
